# Build context for the web image.
#
# ★ The mirror of the API's: `apps/api` is excluded here, because the web build
# needs only `apps/web` and `packages/contracts`. Keeping the two contexts
# disjoint means a change to one app does not invalidate the other's build
# cache.
#
# ★★ `**/.next` matters more than it looks. Without it, a developer's local
# `next build` output is uploaded into the context and copied over the image's
# own — producing a container built from whatever was last run on a laptop.

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs/spikes

# The web image does not contain the API — including its Chromium fonts and
# Prisma engines.
apps/api

docs
*.md

**/coverage
**/.vitest
